011:1":{"text":"简单来说，子瑚就是母瑚的分枝，彼此相互连通。只要将子瑚周围逸散的能量全部回收，母瑚就能恢复生机。","source_cn":"简单来说，子瑚就是母瑚的分枝，彼此相互连通。只要将子瑚...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xBCE0ECEFDE36458C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1910307012:1":{"text":"哟，我说怎么塔拉萨还有人不知道这些，仔细一看，这不是陆地来的小不点吗？","source_cn":"哟，我说怎么塔拉萨还有人不知道这些，仔细一看，这不是陆...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x8C0B4419410308AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1910307013:1":{"text":"你俩怎么还在这？摩淖亚不是送你们回去了吗？","source_cn":"你俩怎么还在这？摩淖亚不是送你们回去了吗？","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xCDF46CBAD2074502","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1910307014:1":{"text":"……摩淖亚。","source_cn":"……摩淖亚。","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xFBE628F0B294E1A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1910307015:1":{"text":"老友们，比起为难两个孩子，眼下最要紧难道不是修复母瑚吗？","source_cn":"老友们，比起为难两个孩子，眼下最要紧难道不是修复母瑚吗？","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xB1CD37CD9A068B62","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1910307016:1":{"text":"子瑚无法像母瑚这样保存能量。再拖下去，它会彻底逸散。","so